{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/e66cd4134f342b2d7d81452c035ed4aa.poster.avif?t=1761082693\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/e66cd4134f342b2d7d81452c035ed4aa.webm?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/fa31f3bba6e7c32d198fc32f194ed9cd.poster.avif?t=1761082693\" width=672 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/fa31f3bba6e7c32d198fc32f194ed9cd.webm?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/fa31f3bba6e7c32d198fc32f194ed9cd.mp4?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woofy Run is a fast-paced multiplayer dog parkour party game where players race, trap, and outsmart each other in chaotic obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite dog breed, customize it with funny outfits, and compete in vibrant, trap-filled arenas. Use your reflexes and strategy to dodge hazards, place traps, and boost your way to the finish line while looking absolutely ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2ffc03ea1d4a1789c35d2402efbfdea3.poster.avif?t=1761082693\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2ffc03ea1d4a1789c35d2402efbfdea3.webm?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2ffc03ea1d4a1789c35d2402efbfdea3.mp4?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong><br><strong>Multiplayer Parkour Racing</strong><br>Join up to 8 players in real-time online races. Create lobbies, invite friends, or challenge random players to high-speed competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trap Your Rivals</strong><br>Place playful traps like fake boosters or slippery bones to throw off other racers and gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Obstacle Courses</strong><br>Run through uniquely themed maps including city parks, carnivals, forests, and space stations. Each course is filled with moving platforms, jump pads, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Dog Customization</strong><br>Earn points during gameplay and spend them on costumes, hats, glasses, and accessories. Express your style with cosmetic unlocks in the in-game shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Breeds</strong><br>Select from 14 dog breeds including Labrador, Shiba Inu, Dalmatian, and Bulldog. Each breed features unique animations and optional special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Each map tracks the Top 10 fastest players globally. Your personal best is always saved, and you can filter leaderboards to see your friends' times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Rewards</strong><br>Complete daily missions, unlock achievements, and gather points to access new customization options. Seasonal events will offer limited-time challenges and skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2f73dc0ae92bc8d97fb09b55cae28553.poster.avif?t=1761082693\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2f73dc0ae92bc8d97fb09b55cae28553.webm?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/2f73dc0ae92bc8d97fb09b55cae28553.mp4?t=1761082693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847070?t=1761082693","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847070?t=1761082693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/c4f28fb17e7f010a92ebe64e0ec54661a3ce951d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761082693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/c4f28fb17e7f010a92ebe64e0ec54661a3ce951d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761082693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3905090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38